  "releaseNotes": "Kafka: every step applies the authentication the same way. The batch steps now use the authentication the fixture puts in the context, and the steps apply the ssl section of a SASL authentication (the broker CA), as KafkaClassFixture did. No code changes needed from 6.15.7. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
